{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-condition--1","attack-operator--1","software--1","software--2","url--1","url--2","url--3","url--4","url--5","instance--3536a568-610f-5570-bba9-6dfe97bc9c2e","instance--fe58d3c1-faa4-512f-a0c3-fa75b622e227","instance--447a27ab-1541-5ade-b50d-bd1caecded2d","instance--b879673b-0c82-5a65-8ee4-4f18f90200fb","instance--e1fdbfcc-98c5-5401-a510-7f70aaad43ca","instance--d110b130-8c28-5cb4-98a0-76aaa8233093","instance--bb170793-a0b8-5a22-b9f9-5dff26468abb","instance--eebd1645-991e-522e-b90e-977b93c23a41","instance--39107eda-f26f-57e3-a17f-9ce0cfe35002","instance--7db1a402-78e0-5eeb-b068-3fdba2005a85","instance--b4ea1ea3-1dd4-546a-970d-88e12ef295bf","instance--ac3ede84-1c08-504e-859d-ed087cccc04e","instance--b71dd864-8d8e-54b4-9f80-679a83fd52e5"],"properties":[["name","Malware distributed via Korean association security program installers"],["description","AhnLab SEcurity intelligence Center (ASEC) recently discovered that malware strains are downloaded into systems when users try to download security programs from a Korean construction-related association\u2019s website."],["scope","incident"],["author",[["name","AhnLab SEcurity intelligence Center (ASEC)"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","asec.ahnlab.com"],["url","https://asec.ahnlab.com/en/61934/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Prompt security program installation"],["description","Upon accessing and attempting to log in to the organization\u2019s website, the website prompts the users to install security programs first (see Figure 1 below)."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1204.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Download malicious installer"],["description","Among the necessary security programs, \u201cNX_PRNMAN\u201d downloads the installer that has the aforementioned malware strains. This particular method is based on the time of analysis in mid-January 2024. Previously around December 2023, the malware strains were included in the security program \u2018TrustPKI\u2019 and distributed through that program."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1583.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Install malware with security program"],["description","When the user downloads and installs the installer, the malware strains are also installed along with the security program."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1204.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Receive external commands"],["description","The two types of malware strains installed through this process are as follows: a backdoor malware that receives the threat actor\u2019s commands externally and then carry them out, and an Infostealer that collects information from the infected systems."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Collect information from infected systems"],["description","The two types of malware strains installed through this process are as follows: a backdoor malware that receives the threat actor\u2019s commands externally and then carry them out, and an Infostealer that collects information from the infected systems. Therefore, users may be victims of user credentials theft, simply by installing security programs from the official website."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0009","technique":"T1005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","When the user downloads and installs the installer, the malware strains are also installed along with the security program."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--36aad375-d405-5e3b-9a7d-4346c75c9f45","120":"instance--acc72955-